cmrelay licensing (work in progress)

The cmrelay source code in this repository is offered under the MIT
licence as well as the GNU General Public License, version 3 or later.

cmrelay-installer, the single file a release builds, is distributed as
a whole under the GPL-3.0-or-later. It bundles a complete relay stack,
and every bundled component stays under its own licence;
THIRD-PARTY.md lists what the installer ships and under what terms.

Everything under vendor/ is copied verbatim
from chatmail/relay and stays under relay's MIT licence.
Everything under patches/ may additionally be used under the licence
of the component the patch applies to, so a hunk can go back upstream.
